   "translation_line": 21396,
   "section": "mod-tome/data/talents/celestial/hymns.lua",
   "source_tag": "tformat",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "Your skill in Hymns now improves your sight in darkness, increasing your infravision radius by %d.\n\t\tAlso, when you end a Hymn, you will gain a buff of a type based on which Hymn you ended.\n\t\tHymn of Shadows increases your movement speed by %d%% for one turn.\n\t\tHymn of Detection makes you invisible (power %d) for %d turns.\n\t\tHymn of Perseverance grants a damage shield (power %d) for %d turns.",
   "target": "咏唱圣诗的娴熟技艺让黑暗不再阻碍你的视线，增加 %d 暗视半径。\n\t\t此外，每当你结束一首圣诗时，你将根据所结束的圣诗获得相应的增益效果：\n\t\t暗影圣诗：增加 %d%% 移动速度，持续 1 回合。\n\t\t侦测圣诗：获得强度 %d 的隐形，持续 %d 回合。\n\t\t坚毅圣诗：获得强度 %d 的伤害护盾，持续 %d 回合。",
   "source_file": "game/modules/tome/data/talents/celestial/hymns.lua @ 624a67329fe2 (pinned core)",
